  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-385befc5-6dbd-4b5d-933f-4a1dab4c413e",
        "text": "Have you ever wanted to share amazing facts about your favorite animal, like the mysterious owl? What if you could create a digital poster or brochure to show off everything you know?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/627fa9c8eb2f28a89896bec4b4af0a1c-trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-panel-1-1f8b34fa-219d-4696-8a82-45dfdea6bcd8.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-80bb72ea-de7b-4cfe-9a67-8eb921db55cf",
        "text": "We'll start by adding all the *content* to our page. Think of it like organizing your facts, headings, and pictures onto a blank sheet. This is where HTML comes in!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c6d557ee87d0fe32693068a8ee4b003c-trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-panel-2-f4503590-a185-4bc8-a04e-230744bc271f.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-eecc6a96-e643-4323-8d0f-8a9f6ab3cea2",
        "text": "Once we have our content, it's time to make it look awesome! We'll use CSS to add colors, choose cool fonts, and arrange everything beautifully, just like designing a professional poster.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6e524271c863ded6a16d9806328fd1a1-trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-panel-3-13448643-76ed-4b10-9644-cd2ff954d19c.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-70bb04c4-fa79-4ca3-aab5-bb4caf058dae",
        "text": "And just like that, you'll have created your very own engaging webpage all about owls, ready to share with the world! It's both informative and beautiful.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7387bdb775201c6de76f9217c2b81159-trampoline--intro-owl-webpage-panel-4-e46d4f8e-6809-42c6-9b1c-8722fda45c95.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce the concept of building a webpage about owls. Explain that students will learn HTML and CSS to create a beautiful and informative page, similar to a digital poster or brochure about owls."
  },
